<!--
  Rewordium AI mark — used in the smartbar quick-action row for AI Rewrite.

  Visual: a stylized jade-leaf glyph with a single internal vein.
  Why this design: the previous icon (sparkle + wand) was generic AI-stock
  art that read as "ChatGPT clone". A leaf ties the mark to the Jade
  assistant branding throughout the app, is distinctive at smartbar size
  (24dp), and avoids the sparkle/star clichés every other keyboard uses
  for its AI feature.

  Drawn as outline-only so it tints cleanly via the smartbar theme.
-->
